Subject: [PATCH] New race and class pairs train at another class's trainers

The app's new race and class pairs (mod-allied-races, on the realm whose
AlliedRaces.Enable is on) find their own class's trainer in another
class's trainers: undead paladins and dwarf shamans at the priest
trainers, human hunters at the warrior trainers, gnome priests and troll
warlocks at the mage trainers, orc mages at the warlock trainers.
ObjectMgr::GetTrainer(creature, player) gives them their class's trainer
whose spells suit them most, in the gossip's trainer option, the trainer
list, buying a spell, resetting talents and seeing the trainer.
